      <ul>
        <li>2026-02-21: project site initialized with PL/EN route structure.</li>
        <li>2026-02-21: main project page implemented (VST, composition, research).</li>
        <li>Next step: replace placeholders with final media and release links.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>
</PageLayout>
